    "items": [
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          1
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Better a poor person who lives with integrity",
          "than someone who has deceitful lips and is a fool."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          2
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Even zeal is not good without knowledge,",
          "and the one who acts hastily sins."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          3
        ],
        "lines": [
          "A person’s own foolishness leads him astray,",
          "yet his heart rages against the Lord."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          4
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Wealth attracts many friends,",
          "but a poor person is separated from his friend."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          5
        ],
        "lines": [
          "A false witness will not go unpunished,",
          "and one who utters lies will not escape."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          6
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Many seek a ruler’s favor,",
          "and everyone is a friend of one who gives gifts."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          7
        ],
        "lines": [
          "All the brothers of a poor person hate him;",
          "how much more do his friends",
          "keep their distance from him!",
          "He may pursue them with words,",
          "but they are not there."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          8
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The one who acquires good sense loves himself;",
          "one who safeguards understanding finds success."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          9
        ],
        "lines": [
          "A false witness will not go unpunished,",
          "and one who utters lies perishes."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          10
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Luxury is not appropriate for a fool #— #",
          "how much less for a slave to rule over princes!"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          11
        ],
        "lines": [
          "A person’s insight gives him patience,",
          "and his virtue is to overlook an offense."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          12
        ],
        "lines": [
          "A king’s rage is like the roaring of a lion,",
          "but his favor is like dew on the grass."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          13
        ],
        "lines": [
          "A foolish son is his father’s ruin,",
          "and a wife’s nagging is an endless dripping."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          14
        ],
        "lines": [
          "A house and wealth are inherited from fathers,",
          "but a prudent wife is from the Lord."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          15
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Laziness induces deep sleep,",
          "and a lazy person will go hungry."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          16
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The one who keeps commands preserves himself;",
          "one who disregards his ways will die."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          17
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Kindness to the poor is a loan to the Lord,",
          "and he will give a reward to the lender. ,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          18
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Discipline your son while there is hope;",
          "don’t set your heart on being the cause of his death. ,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          19
        ],
        "lines": [
          "A person with intense anger bears the penalty;",
          "if you rescue him, you’ll have to do it again."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          20
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Listen to counsel and receive instruction",
          "so that you may be wise later in life. ,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          21
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Many plans are in a person’s heart,",
          "but the Lord’s decree will prevail."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          22
        ],
        "lines": [
          "What is desirable in a person is his fidelity;",
          "better to be a poor person than a liar."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          23
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The fear of the Lord leads to life;",
          "one will sleep at night without danger."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          24
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The slacker buries his hand in the bowl;",
          "he doesn’t even bring it back to his mouth!"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          25
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Strike a mocker, and the inexperienced learn a lesson;",
          "rebuke the discerning, and he gains knowledge."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          26
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The one who plunders his father and evicts his mother",
          "is a disgraceful and shameful son."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          27
        ],
        "lines": [
          "If you stop listening to correction, my son,",
          "you will stray from the words of knowledge."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          28
        ],
        "lines": [
          "A worthless witness mocks justice,",
          "and a wicked mouth swallows iniquity."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          29
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Judgments are prepared for mockers,",
          "and beatings for the backs of fools."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      }
    ]
  },
